49:     <main>
50:       <section class="left" aria-label="Game screen">
51:         <div class="screen-head"><span>▰ &nbsp;GAME WINDOW</span><b id="screenState">NO SIGNAL</b></div>
52:         <div class="screen-frame"><div class="screen" id="screen">
53:           <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="256" height="240" aria-label="NES game display"></canvas>
54:           <div class="idle" id="idle"><div class="idle-content"><div class="pixel-sword">⚔</div><h1>THE LEGEND<br>AWAITS</h1><p>Insert your own Zelda.nes cartridge file to begin your adventure.</p><button class="load-btn" id="chooseRom">INSERT CARTRIDGE</button><input id="romInput" class="file-input" type="file" accept=".nes,application/octet-stream"><p class="drop-hint">or drop a .nes file into this window</p></div></div>
55:         </div></div>
56:         <div class="toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><button id="pauseBtn" title="Pause or resume" disabled>Ⅱ &nbsp;PAUSE</button><button id="resetBtn" title="Reset game" disabled>↻ &nbsp;RESET</button><span class="game-name" id="gameName">No cartridge inserted</span></div><button class="small-icon fullscreen" id="fullscreenBtn" title="Fullscreen">⛶</button></div>
57:         <div class="error" id="errorMsg" role="alert"></div>
58:         <div class="touch-controls" aria-label="Touch controls">
59:           <div class="dpad">
60:             <button class="pad up" data-button="UP" aria-label="Up">▲</button><button class="pad down" data-button="DOWN" aria-label="Down">▼</button><button class="pad left" data-button="LEFT" aria-label="Left">◀</button><button class="pad right" data-button="RIGHT" aria-label="Right">▶</button><div class="pad center"></div>
61:           </div>
62:           <div class="action-pad"><button data-button="B" aria-label="B button">B</button><button data-button="A" aria-label="A button">A</button></div>
63:         </div>
64:       </section>
65:       <aside class="side">
66:         <h2 class="side-title">YOUR ADVENTURE STARTS HERE</h2>
67:         <section class="card"><h3 class="card-title">Bring your cartridge</h3><p>This player does not include game files. Load a legally obtained NES ROM from your device to play.</p><div class="file-card"><div class="file-icon">▤</div><div><strong id="romFileName">Zelda.nes</strong><span>NES ROM · .nes format</span></div><button class="tiny-button" id="browseBtn">BROWSE</button></div></section>
68:         <section class="card"><h3 class="card-title">Controls</h3><p>Keyboard or touch controls</p><div class="controls"><div class="control"><span class="keys"><i class="key">↑</i></span> Move up</div><div class="control"><span class="key">Z</span> Sword / B</div><div class="control"><span class="keys"><i class="key">←</i><i class="key">↓</i><i class="key">→</i></span> Move</div><div class="control"><span class="key">X</span> Item / A</div><div class="control"><span class="key">Enter</span> Start</div><div class="control"><span class="key">Shift</span> Select</div></div><p class="note">Tip: Click the game first if keyboard input doesn't respond.</p></section>
